1
00:00:00,124 --> 00:00:04,794
(Leonard:)Sheldon, you can't train my girlfriend
like a lab rat.

2
00:00:05,379 --> 00:00:07,839
(Sheldon:)Actually, it turns out I can.

3
00:00:08,591 --> 00:00:10,221
(Leonard:)Well, you shouldn't.

4
00:00:10,384 --> 00:00:13,014
Oh, ugh.
There's just no pleasing you, is there?

5
00:00:13,179 --> 00:00:15,559
(Sheldon:)You weren't happy
with my approach with her...

6
00:00:15,723 --> 00:00:18,973
(Sheldon:)...so I decided to employ operant
conditioning techniques...

7
00:00:19,143 --> 00:00:21,853
...building on the works of Thorndike
and B.F. Skinner.

8
00:00:22,021 --> 00:00:24,771
(Sheldon:)Next week, I believe
I can have her jumping out of a pool...

9
00:00:24,940 --> 00:00:27,730
(Sheldon:)...balancing a beach ball on her nose.

10
00:00:28,402 --> 00:00:31,362
(Leonard:)No, this has to stop now.

11
00:00:31,530 --> 00:00:35,530
(Sheldon:)I'm not suggesting we really make her
jump out of a pool.

12
00:00:35,701 --> 00:00:37,491
I thought the "buzzinga" was implied.

13
00:00:38,621 --> 00:00:42,871
(Sheldon:)I'm just tweaking her personality,
sanding off the rough edges, if you will.

14
00:00:43,042 --> 00:00:45,082
(Leonard:)No, you're not sanding Penny.

15
00:00:45,711 --> 00:00:49,921
Are you saying that I am forbidden
from applying a harmless...

16
00:00:50,132 --> 00:00:53,262
(Sheldon:)...scientifically valid protocol
that will make our lives better?

17
00:00:53,636 --> 00:00:59,026
(Leonard:)Yes, you're forbidden.

